| !Run for !PiperSay: sets PiperSay$Dir and the PiperSay command, and loads
| the sound modules PiperSay -p plays through (as !SoftMIDI's LoadSound does).
Set PiperSay$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Alias$PiperSay WimpSlot -min 4000K|MRun <PiperSay$Dir>.PiperSay %*0
| SharedSoundBuffer and StreamManager are by John Duffell and aren't
| included (their terms don't allow it); see !Help.
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSound Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSound
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
| SharedSoundBuffer only if the two modules it needs are there.
Set PiperSay$SSB 1
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 Set PiperSay$SSB 0
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 Set PiperSay$SSB 0
If "<PiperSay$SSB>" = "1" Then RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer
Unset PiperSay$SSB
